{"overview":"در شهر کاه‌پوشی که در حال فروپاشی است، ریڈپچ، اوهایو، شب‌ها طولانی‌تر، سایه‌ها سنگین‌تر و غریبه‌ها هیچ‌وقت بدون دلیل نمی‌آیند. پس از اینکه پدرش را به دلیل حمله‌ی یک حیوان عجیب از دست داد، مدیر داینی که سوخته است، لامونت گست، با یک مهاجر مرموز روبه‌رو می‌شود – بیلکو، کشتارچی خون‌آشام خسته از راه – و به زودی خود را درگیر نبردی علیه شرابزار قدیمی می‌یابد که شهر او را خشک می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In the fading rustbelt town of Redpatch, Ohio, nights feel longer, shadows heavier, and strangers never arrive without reason. After losing his father to a strange animal attack, burned-out diner manager Lamont Guest crosses paths with a mysterious drifter - the road-weary vampire slayer Belko - and soon finds himself drawn into battle against the ancient evil that's bleeding his hometown dry.","tagline_en":"Ancient evil has a new home.","runtime":96,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Jeremy Herbert"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Morgan McLeod","role":"Lamont Guest","photo":""},{"name":"Mark Kelly","role":"Belko","photo":"/mnXgwTVNPGqJyNmLP1neATTsvy2.jpg"},{"name":"Ross Partridge","role":"The Boss","photo":"/4GCbT5B0WeoDkl5gor8NuAvy4mV.jpg"},{"name":"Beau Roberts","role":"Sheriff Schaeffer","photo":""},{"name":"Diana Frankhauser","role":"Marlene Fenton","photo":""},{"name":"Jonathan Tazewell","role":"Joe Guest","photo":""},{"name":"LaKeta Caston","role":"Adrienne Guest","photo":"/iFvM4OBQ3qi2ra4KCSp27UKY0jv.jpg"},{"name":"Jim Azelvandre","role":"Terence","photo":""},{"name":"David Sollberger","role":"Bud","photo":""},{"name":"Chris Hahn","role":"The Trucker","photo":"/yk1PyDpecsqybv9mepCYylKks0k.jpg"},{"name":"Philip R. Garrett","role":"Tunnel Tom","photo":"/8CPoR54AEtk4IkJpZu5pXoKKw6b.jpg"},{"name":"David Greathouse","role":"Drive-In Dave","photo":""}],"trailer":"FxgJEes0bOg","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1536756-blood-rust/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatr